        \"CHEMBL1121680\", \"doi\": \"10.1021/jm00140a005\", \"doi_chembl\": null,
        \"first_page\": \"933\", \"issue\": \"8\", \"journal\": \"J Med Chem\", \"journal_full_title\":
        \"Journal of medicinal chemistry.\", \"last_page\": \"941\", \"patent_id\":
